  <item>
    <title>在贵阳做民宿 500 天：像在家一样旅行，像在地一样生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c28cd7bf52a16cd1c3bcf1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c28cd7bf52a16cd1c3bcf1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Mar 2025 04:38:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>我们在贵阳的民宿，运营500天纪念！</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XZqYtutc7sKvSBDuUTSRwA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XZqYtutc7sKvSBDuUTSRwA"><span>戳这里看看我们在贵阳的民宿</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8qXEkTeYDvR4tzfIw3M6RA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/8qXEkTeYDvR4tzfIw3M6RA"><span>我们在西双版纳也有一间民宿哦</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>500天，接待了超过100组住客，</span><br><span>我们也陪伴了超过100次互联网好朋友们的贵州旅行。</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>这也是我们第一次，</span><br><span>讲述我们做这间民宿的背后的设计思考与故事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>它很小，只有一间90m²的两居室，</span><br><span>每年最多也只能接待不超过200组客人，</span><br><span>但它也很大，大到成为了上百人探索贵州的起点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>它是我们的家，</span><br><span>也是你们在贵阳的家。</span><br><span>我们也希望，</span><br><span>你可以借此打开一个不同的、真正的贵阳与贵州。</span></p><span></span><p><span>若说一个人最快乐的事，</span><br><span>莫过做一件自己喜欢的事，而且这件事还能被认可，</span><br><span>同时还能帮助对的人，帮助他们拥有更好的人生体验。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎来贵阳，探索中国最具风味且集中的美食体验。</span><br><span>欢迎来贵州，打开从山川、瀑布、溪谷到村寨、手工艺的地图。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>要记得，在贵阳，你有一个舒服的家。</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>订房微信：laiwojiazhu</span></strong><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6492bd0a000000001c02b957?xsec_token=YBGH4I4STF0O8QYkIyG4pVmh2ENnp4IND43NMC8XhqThU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5dcd225b0000000001008344&amp;apptime=1740803136&amp;share_id=3ba5d00dae6445308e9925a172ce757f" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/6492bd0a000000001c02b957?xsec_token=YBGH4I4STF0O8QYkIyG4pVmh2ENnp4IND43NMC8XhqThU=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5dcd225b0000000001008344&amp;apptime=1740803136&amp;share_id=3ba5d00dae6445308e9925a172ce757f"><span>来关注我们的小红书</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1yVO0i28W12ApouNp4DGcIoa4X.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-7ZlljVpAShdHxdw45fh8LtjPn.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmh2CikCWcTla8lLB8wZKIeToznd.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FplDmD_rPjA_975K4KvfQ05c0qSJ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjnFkhjEUQJeQBEJYYbJrLn1TX6Q.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikKiMgI2Av_oaDt95dbz5V45_eY.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvy4fHcAPvOBOdQmrhT8ykBf-g2r.JPG"></figure>]]></description>
