  <item>
    <title>稻城自驾，精髓其实都在路上！（附送呼伦贝尔自驾tips</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66153bd55dae7932c66a0c45</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66153bd55dae7932c66a0c45</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 13:00:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>往返5天的稻城自驾，到底怎么玩儿？且听我们一步步给大家讲！湖泊、雪山、苔原、垭口、森林、草场……这条黄金自驾路线，请不要忽视路边的任何一处美景。本期内含超过10处实用旅行预警提示！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后一段（51分开始）附送呼伦贝尔自驾行tips</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集电梯：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 开上折多山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 抵达理塘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 向稻城进发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 抵达稻城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 稻城景区大吵架，有人能懂？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 离开稻城的种种意外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 新都桥、贡嘎山峰的正确打开方式，这里告诉你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 折多山大堵车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">51:35</a> 呼伦贝尔之行</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpsQ-mRmieE1ZHCVrheLLtb1chPd.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>翻越折多山</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FthRWG9lEjS261DaNdsT8t4BSIbN.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>折多山垭口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNXrBPM59RB70puQ64WOFHAFcII.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>我拍下了自己的「佛光」</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZL2jt_LxBsMGNJqhjxl5vzXCK6.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>西出理塘，如新疆般的森林</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtqIbSqRTw2aAswcvleQ1H16QNRa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>西出理塘</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1-S9rdMqjDbWCg-InVhn5BGZri.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>西出理塘的盘山公路</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJZvWWAthohx3zcPURUQwxVVFIK.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>临近稻城，河谷中的事故车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoTh9PssZ2fuvntJGL_lsA8lYUkc.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>超级无敌美的稻城！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhxK7SkWAxBvaNbh0MtFCctuATEP.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>超级超级美的稻城景区尽头</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlN83ASrbZy_be5Xg0kL9QWSlb_C.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>稻城附近</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv6z7mfxP5RABMlL9g8yQHHXtev2.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新都桥垭口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2mVarMhI9_-ViPvDQLp3qwdqeD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新都桥垭口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FodfLnsXRJCGZLHKOdz-EShgMS1W.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>新都桥民俗老板的女儿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFXM6K8QepP8wzao0Vz7D4P-dfl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>回程折多山大堵车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjDsbpJdpYvnc6Jvmv2-6HBv1Yh8.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>自驾旅行的优势：带许多东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的播客对自己毫无营养，但希望带给你们一些什么东西，是什么都行。为了不占用工作时间，播客选题随机，录制简单，剪辑更是四舍五入约等于没有。这样还有个目的，希望你们听的时候，就如同跟我们在同一屋檐下生活，有没有get这种feel呢？因为我俩每天生活都这样，随机且有趣，偶尔会突然深刻，但总体非常散漫。</span></p><span></span><p><span>注意，我说的是生活，生活，不是工作！</span></p><span></span><p><span>好啦！想听我们聊啥话题？评论区告诉我们！</span></p>]]></description>
